  "_about": [
    "Curated academic structure for the University of Jos. Replaces the JAMB IBASS 'faculty groups' (MEDICAL, ADMINISTRATION ...) for this institution.",
    "Every IBASS programme is listed under 'from' by its existing id, so profiles that chose it keep working: the row is moved and renamed, never deleted. A second id in 'from' is a duplicate that gets merged into the first.",
    "'placeholder': true marks a department that is really the programme itself (one degree taught across several teaching departments, e.g. MBBS, LL.B.); it is stored with derived=true.",
    "Faculties with no undergraduate programme (Faculty of Basic Clinical Sciences; Faculty of Communication and Media Studies, whose page is not live and whose Mass Communication programme is still admitted under the Faculty of Arts in 2026/27) are left out so the picker never offers an empty faculty."
  ],
